# VHS tape for checkbox width and wrapping demo

Output examples/vhs/checkbox_width_wrapping.gif

Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1130
Set Height 860
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "clear && cargo run --release --example checkbox_width_wrapping"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

# Show the demo running
Sleep 3s

# Quit the demo
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
